== mapping: normalisation
ok lower case
ok mixed case and spaces around the length
ok white space is collapsed
ok also a line break
ok two numbers in the suffix
ok a quoted type name
== mapping: affinity rules for other names
ok contains INT
ok INT wins over FLOA
ok contains CHAR
ok contains CLOB
ok contains TEXT
ok contains BLOB
ok contains REAL
ok contains DOUB
ok anything else
ok another unknown name
== mapping: the auto-increment key
ok INTEGER PRIMARY KEY is the auto-increment key
ok in any spelling, with AUTOINCREMENT
ok declared as a table constraint
ok under another column name
ok INT PRIMARY KEY is not the row id
ok a key of two columns is not
ok the key of a WITHOUT ROWID table is not
ok BIGINT PRIMARY KEY is not
ok an explicit rowid column is a largeint
== mapping: expression columns
ok typed by the storage class of the first row
ok no rows: strings
ok aggregates and expressions over an empty table
ok aggregates with rows
ok expressions over table columns
ok columns declared without a type follow the first row
ok a CAST is an expression
== mapping: Required
ok NOT NULL columns without a default
ok never an expression column
ok a NOT NULL key that is not auto-increment
ok none in a ReadOnly query
ok none without a key: the query is read-only
ok none in a join
