== read: string and memo fields
ok TEXT storage
ok an empty text is not null
ok the declared length does not cut a stored value
ok a memo
ok a number is stored as text by the column
ok NULL is null
ok a string column typed by its first row takes the numbers of later rows as text
== read: blob fields
ok BLOB storage
ok a zero-length blob is empty, not null
ok TEXT gives its bytes
ok a number gives the bytes of its text
ok NULL is null
