ok the query is updatable
ok the row is inserted
ok an integer field is INTEGER
ok a largeint field is INTEGER
ok a boolean field is INTEGER 1
ok a float field is REAL
ok a string field is TEXT
ok a memo field is TEXT
ok a blob field is BLOB
