ok a time field is TEXT HH:MM:SS
ok a date-time field is TEXT YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS
ok a second row
ok an unassigned field is NULL
ok False is INTEGER 0
ok a negative float
ok an empty string is empty TEXT, not NULL
ok an empty memo too
ok an empty blob is an empty BLOB, not NULL
ok a year below 1000 has four digits
ok milliseconds are appended when not zero
ok also in a date-time
ok an update binds the same way
ok a cleared field is NULL
ok a date-time with milliseconds
